                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection Modern L018 Lever With R017 Square Rose - With its fantastic shape, Baldwin L018 Lever will add modern appeal to any space. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of both contemporary and traditional finishes. It will fit 1-3/8 inches and 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-L018, Baldwin sleek leversets, baldwin L018 levers, solid brass leversets, contemporary levers, contemporary levesets, baldwin L018 leversets, baldwin estates collections, baldwin modern levers, ada compliant levers, R017 roses, Square roses,"
